layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Contact
description: "How to contact Band of One about articles, corrections, products or support."
---
<p>We read every message. We aim to reply within two business days (Monday to Friday).</p>
<h2 id="email">Email</h2>
{%- if site.supportEmail %}
<p><a href="mailto:{{ site.supportEmail }}">{{ site.supportEmail }}</a></p>
{%- else %}
<p class="note"><strong>[SUPPORT EMAIL: add before launch]</strong> The support inbox hasn't been set up yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
<h2 id="what-to-include">What to include</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Product support:</strong> the product name and, if you can, your order email or receipt number. Never send passwords or card details.</li>
  <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> the article link and what needs fixing. We update articles and note the change date.</li>
  <li><strong>Everything else:</strong> a line or two is plenty.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="not-offered">What we can't help with</h2>
<p>We can't give legal, tax, accounting or financial advice, or review individual contracts. Please speak to a qualified professional where you work.</p>
<p>We don't accept paid guest posts or undisclosed sponsored content.</p>
